"username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "3. The Sony Handycam CCD-F77, bought by an Argentinian immigrant plumber in Los Angeles as a Valentine’s Day gift for his wife, ended up recording three things on the same tape: Arnold Schwarzenegger shooting Terminator 2: Judgment Day at a biker bar, X, and the LA Marathon.\nA friend suggested he take the tape to a local TV station. The station paid him $500 and a fleece jacket for it. Within months, X had been broadcast so many times that a CNN executive called it “wallpaper,” while his lawyer described it as “the most-played video in the history of this country.” He went on to send over 900 cease-and-desist letters to outlets that aired it without permission, demanding $7,500 each, but never profited meaningfully. The FBI confiscated the camera as evidence and returned it roughly 24 years later, without the tape, which they still hold.\nHe later put the camera up for auction with a starting bid of $225,000. There were zero bids. Id X.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:40:33Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "rodney king", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:40:34Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "beating", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:40:56Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Rodney King, born on this day in 1965.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:41:00Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Great question and great crack", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:41:07Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Ek saal se reh gaya @⁨~Ricky⁩", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:41